probe-rs is a toolkit for flashing and debugging embedded
microcontrollers.  It supports a wide range of debug probes
(CMSIS-DAP/DAPLink, ST-Link, J-Link, FTDI, WCH-Link, Black Magic Probe,
etc.) and targets ARM Cortex-M, RISC-V and Xtensa cores.

The package installs:

  * probe-rs       - CLI for flashing, debugging, RTT/defmt logging,
                     semihosting and running GDB/DAP servers
  * cargo-flash    - `cargo flash` frontend for probe-rs
  * cargo-embed    - `cargo embed` frontend with RTT/GDB integration
  * target-gen     - generates probe-rs target descriptions from
                     CMSIS-SVD files
